# npm pack output — a build artifact, and it embeds whatever is in presets/ at the time.
*.tgz

# Third-party brand logos (trademarked artwork, not ours to redistribute).
# presets/brands.json names each logo by an absolute ~/ path; a local copy kept
# inside the clone under Logos/ must stay out of the repository.
Logos/
